st fausse."},{"content":"L'implication est fausse, sa réciproque est vraie."},{"content":"L'implication et sa réciproque sont fausses."}],"statement":"Soit $n$ un entier naturel. On considère l'implication : « si $n$ est un multiple de ${{a}}$, alors {{if:j=3|$n+{{D}}$ est un multiple de ${{a}}$|$n$ est un multiple de ${{b}}$}} ».\n\nQue peut-on dire de cette implication et de sa réciproque ?","variables":[{"name":"j","expression":"0..3"},{"name":"m","expression":"2..6"},{"name":"c","expression":"2..4"},{"name":"i0","expression":"{{eval:(1-j)*(2-j)*(3-j)/6}}"},{"name":"i1","expression":"{{eval:j*(2-j)*(3-j)/2}}"},{"name":"i2","expression":"{{eval:j*(j-1)*(3-j)/2}}"},{"name":"a","expression":"{{eval:m*c^i0}}"},{"name":"b","expression":"{{eval:m*c^i1+i2*c}}"},{"name":"D","expression":"{{eval:m*c}}"},{"name":"q","expression":"{{eval:a/m}}"},{"name":"r","expression":"{{eval:b/m}}"}],"conditions":["i2 = 0 or (a % b != 0 and b % a != 0)"],"correction":{"steps":["La réciproque est : « si {{if:j=3|$n+{{D}}$ est un multiple de ${{a}}$, alors $n$ est un multiple de ${{a}}$|$n$ est un multiple de ${{b}}$, alors $n$ est un multiple de ${{a}}$}} ».","{{if:j=0|**L'implication est vraie** : si $n={{a}}k$, alors $n={{b}}\\times({{q}}k)$ car ${{a}}={{b}}\\times{{q}}$.}}{{if:j=1|**L'implication est fausse** : $n={{a}}$ est un multiple de ${{a}}$ mais pas de ${{b}}$.}}{{if:j=2|**L'implication est fausse** : $n={{a}}$ est un multiple de ${{a}}$ mais pas de ${{b}}$.}}{{if:j=3|**L'implication est vraie** : si $n={{a}}k$, alors $n+{{D}}={{a}}(k+{{c}})$.}}","{{if:j=0|**La réciproque est fausse** : $n={{b}}$ est un multiple de ${{b}}$ mais pas de ${{a}}$.}}{{if:j=1|**La réciproque est vraie** : si $n={{b}}k$, alors $n={{a}}\\times({{r}}k)$ car ${{b}}={{a}}\\times{{r}}$.}}{{if:j=2|**La réciproque est fausse** : $n={{b}}$ est un multiple de ${{b}}$ mais pas de ${{a}}$.}}{{if:j=3|**La réciproque est vraie** : si $n+{{D}}={{a}}k$, alors $n={{a}}k-{{D}}={{a}}(k-{{c}})$.}}","Une implication et sa réciproque sont deux propositions différentes : l'une peut être vraie et l'autre fausse. Quand les deux sont vraies, on dit que les propositions sont **équivalentes**."]},"correctChoiceIndex":["{{eval:mod(j+1,4)}}"]}],"shared":null,"test_specs":[{"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"a":"3","c":"2","k":"0","m":"2","p":"0"},"description":"réciproque x=3 : bonne réponse","variationIndex":0,"selectedChoices":[0]},{"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"a":"3","c":"2","k":"0","m":"2","p":"0"},"description":"réciproque x=3 : autre choix refusé","variationIndex":0,"selectedChoices":[1]},{"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"a":"3","c":"3","k":"1","m":"2","p":"2"},"description":"réciproque multiples : bonne réponse","variationIndex":0,"selectedChoices":[2]},{"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"a":"3","c":"3","k":"1","m":"2","p":"2"},"description":"réciproque multiples : autre choix refusé","variationIndex":0,"selectedChoices":[3]},{"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"c":"2","j":"0","m":"3"},"description":"mult 6 ⇒ mult 3 : bonne réponse","variationIndex":1,"selectedChoices":[1]},{"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"c":"2","j":"0","m":"3"},"description":"mult 6 ⇒ mult 3 : autre choix refusé","variationIndex":1,"selectedChoices":[2]},{"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"c":"2","j":"1","m":"3"},"description":"mult 3 ⇒ mult 6 : bonne réponse","variationIndex":1,"selectedChoices":[2]},{"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"c":"2","j":"1","m":"3"},"description":"mult 3 ⇒ mult 6 : autre choix refusé","variationIndex":1,"selectedChoices":[3]},{"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"c":"2","j":"2","m":"4"},"description":"mult 4 ⇒ mult 6 : bonne réponse","variationIndex":1,"selectedChoices":[3]},{"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"c":"2","j":"2","m":"4"},"description":"mult 4 ⇒ mult 6 : autre choix refusé","variationIndex":1,"selectedChoices":[0]},{"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"c":"2","j":"3","m":"4"},"description":"mult 4 ⇒ n+8 mult 4 : bonne réponse","variationIndex":1,"selectedChoices":[0]},{"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"c":"2","j":"3","m":"4"},"description":"mult 4 ⇒ n+8 mult 4 : autre choix refusé","variationIndex":1,"selectedChoices":[1]}]}$plh$::jsonb,
