  $plh${"title":"Résoudre sin x > a sur un tour","description":"Inéquation sin x > a, a valeur remarquable, résolue dans [0 ; 2π[ ; réponse : intervalle ou réunion","variations":[{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"]{{a}};\\frac{ {{u}}\\pi}{ {{w}} }["}],"statement":"Résous dans $\\left[0\\,;2\\pi\\right[$ l'inéquation $\\sin x>{{eval:sin(n*\\pi/12)}}$.\n\nL'ensemble des solutions est $S=?$.","variables":[{"name":"a","expression":"\\frac{\\pi}{6}|\\frac{\\pi}{4}|\\frac{\\pi}{3}"},{"name":"n","expression":"eval:12*a/\\pi"},{"name":"c","expression":"eval:n/gcd(abs(n),12)"},{"name":"q","expression":"eval:12/gcd(abs(n),12)"},{"name":"u","expression":"eval:(12-n)/gcd(12-n,12)"},{"name":"w","expression":"eval:12/gcd(12-n,12)"}],"correction":{"steps":["$\\sin {{a}}=\\sin \\frac{ {{u}}\\pi}{ {{w}} }={{eval:sin(n*\\pi/12)}}$. Sur le cercle, les points d'ordonnée strictement supérieure à ${{eval:sin(n*\\pi/12)}}$ forment l'arc qui va de ${{a}}$ à $\\frac{ {{u}}\\pi}{ {{w}} }$.","```trig\npreset: custom\nangles: {{c}}*pi/{{q}}, {{u}}*pi/{{w}}\nequation: sin(x) > sin({{n}}*pi/12)\nmode: arc\n```","$S=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{\\left]{{a}}\\,;\\frac{ {{u}}\\pi}{ {{w}} }\\right[ }$."]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"[0;\\frac{ {{u}}\\pi}{ {{w}} }[\\cup]\\frac{ {{g}}\\pi}{ {{h}} };2\\pi["}],"statement":"Résous dans $\\left[0\\,;2\\pi\\right[$ l'inéquation $\\sin x>{{eval:-sin(n*\\pi/12)}}$.\n\nL'ensemble des solutions est $S=?$.","variables":[{"name":"a","expression":"\\frac{\\pi}{6}|\\frac{\\pi}{4}|\\frac{\\pi}{3}"},{"name":"n","expression":"eval:12*a/\\pi"},{"name":"c","expression":"eval:n/gcd(abs(n),12)"},{"name":"q","expression":"eval:12/gcd(abs(n),12)"},{"name":"u","expression":"eval:(12+n)/gcd(12+n,12)"},{"name":"w","expression":"eval:12/gcd(12+n,12)"},{"name":"g","expression":"eval:(24-n)/gcd(24-n,12)"},{"name":"h","expression":"eval:12/gcd(24-n,12)"}],"correction":{"steps":["$\\sin \\frac{ {{u}}\\pi}{ {{w}} }=\\sin \\frac{ {{g}}\\pi}{ {{h}} }={{eval:-sin(n*\\pi/12)}}$. Sur