insert into _plh_neufs values ('0598a535-b015-4367-a775-fccf2e9b3151', '9724dc3d-8df6-4c45-b936-439b18ed4c39', 3,
  $plh${"title":"Intersection de deux ensembles finis","description":"Écrire A ∩ B pour des ensembles finis donnés en extension ou par leurs diviseurs","variations":[{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"\\{ {{w3}};{{w8}} \\}"}],"statement":"On considère l'ensemble $E=\\{ {{w1}};{{w2}};{{w3}};{{w4}};{{w5}};{{w6}};{{w7}};{{w8}};{{w9}} \\}$ et ses deux parties\n\n$$A=\\{ {{w1}};{{w3}};{{w4}};{{w7}};{{w8}} \\}\\quad\\text{et}\\quad B=\\{ {{w2}};{{w3}};{{w6}};{{w8}} \\}.$$\n\nÉcris cet ensemble entre accolades, en séparant les éléments par des points-virgules (par exemple $\\{1;3;5\\}$) ; l'ensemble vide s'écrit $\\varnothing$.\n\n$A\\cap B=?$","variables":[{"name":"w1","expression":"1..3"},{"name":"k1","expression":"1..3"},{"name":"w2","expression":"{{eval:w1+k1}}"},{"name":"k2","expression":"1..3"},{"name":"w3","expression":"{{eval:w2+k2}}"},{"name":"k3","expression":"1..3"},{"name":"w4","expression":"{{eval:w3+k3}}"},{"name":"k4","expression":"1..3"},{"name":"w5","expression":"{{eval:w4+k4}}"},{"name":"k5","expression":"1..3"},{"name":"w6","expression":"{{eval:w5+k5}}"},{"name":"k6","expression":"1..3"},{"name":"w7","expression":"{{eval:w6+k6}}"},{"name":"k7","expression":"1..3"},{"name":"w8","expression":"{{eval:w7+k7}}"},{"name":"k8","expression":"1..3"},{"name":"w9","expression":"{{eval:w8+k8}}"}],"correction":{"steps":["$A\\cap B$ contient les éléments qui sont **à la fois** dans $A$ et dans $B$ : $A\\cap B=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{\\{ {{w3}};{{w8}} \\}}$."]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"\\{ 1;{{p}} \\}"}],"statement":"On note $E$ l'ensemble des diviseurs positifs de ${{eval:p*s*t}}$, $A$ l'ensemble des diviseurs positifs de ${{eval:p*q}}$ et $B$ l'ensemble des diviseurs positifs de ${{eval:p*r}}$.\n\nÉcris cet ensemble entre accolades, en séparant les éléments par des points-virgules (par exemple $\\{1;3;5\\}$) ; l'ensemble vide s'écrit $\\varnothing$.\n\n$A\\cap B=?$","variables":[{"name":"p","expression":"2|3"},{"name":"s","expression":"3|5"},{"name":"t","expression":"5|7"},{"name":"f","expression":"0..1"},{"name":"q","expression":"{{eval:f*s+(1-f)*t}}"},{"name":"r","expression":"{{eval:f*t+(1-f)*s}}"}],"conditions":["p < s","s < t","t < p*s"],"correction":{"steps":["${{eval:p*q}}={{p}}\\times{{q}}$, donc $A=\\{ 1;{{p}};{{q}};{{eval:p*q}} \\}$ ; ${{eval:p*r}}={{p}}\\times{{r}}$, donc $B=\\{ 1;{{p}};{{r}};{{eval:p*r}} \\}$.","Éléments communs à $A$ et $B$ : $A\\cap B=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{\\{ 1;{{p}} \\}}$ (ce sont les diviseurs de ${{p}}$)."]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"\\{ {{w4}};{{w7}} \\}"}],"statement":"On considère l'ensemble $E=\\{ {{w1}};{{w2}};{{w3}};{{w4}};{{w5}};{{w6}};{{w7}};{{w8}} \\}$ et ses deux parties\n\n$$A=\\{ {{w2}};{{w4}};{{w5}};{{w7}} \\}\\quad\\text{et}\\quad B=\\{ {{w1}};{{w4}};{{w6}};{{w7}} \\}.$$\n\nÉcris cet ensemble entre accolades, en séparant les éléments par des points-virgules (par exemple $\\{1;3;5\\}$) ; l'ensemble vide s'écrit $\\varnothing$.\n\n$A\\cap B=?$","variables":[{"name":"w1","expression":"1..4"},{"name":"k1","expression":"1..4"},{"name":"w2","expression":"{{eval:w1+k1}}"},{"name":"k2","expression":"1..4"},{"name":"w3","expression":"{{eval:w2+k2}}"},{"name":"k3","expression":"1..4"},{"name":"w4","expression":"{{eval:w3+k3}}"},{"name":"k4","expression":"1..4"},{"name":"w5","expression":"{{eval:w4+k4}}"},{"name":"k5","expression":"1..4"},{"name":"w6","expression":"{{eval:w5+k5}}"},{"name":"k6","expression":"1..4"},{"name":"w7","expression":"{{eval:w6+k6}}"},{"name":"k7","expression":"1..4"},{"name":"w8","expression":"{{eval:w7+k7}}"}],"correction":{"steps":["$A\\cap B$ contient les éléments qui sont **à la fois** dans $A$ et dans $B$ : $A\\cap B=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{\\{ {{w4}};{{w7}} \\}}$."]}}],"shared":{"blankDefaults":{"answerKind":"intervalles"}},"test_specs":[{"answers":["\\{8;17\\}"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"k1":"2","k2":"3","k3":"1","k4":"3","k5":"1","k6":"2","k7":"2","k8":"3","w1":"3"},"description":"v0 : juste","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["\\{17;8\\}"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"k1":"2","k2":"3","k3":"1","k4":"3","k5":"1","k6":"2","k7":"2","k8":"3","w1":"3"},"description":"v0 : ordre quelconque","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["\\{8,17\\}"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"k1":"2","k2":"3","k3":"1","k4":"3","k5":"1","k6":"2","k7":"2","k8":"3","w1":"3"},"description":"v0 : virgules au lieu de points-virgules","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["\\{3;5;8;9;13;15;17\\}"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"k1":"2","k2":"3","k3":"1","k4":"3","k5":"1","k6":"2","k7":"2","k8":"3","w1":"3"},"description":"v0 : réunion au lieu de l'intersection","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["\\{1;2\\}"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"f":"1","p":"2","s":"3","t":"5"},"description":"v1 : diviseurs de 6, 10, 30 : juste","variationIndex":1},{"answers":["\\{1;2\\}"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"f":"0","p":"2","s":"5","t":"7"},"description":"v1 : diviseurs de 14, 10, 70 (rôles échangés) : juste","variationIndex":1},{"answers":["\\{2\\}"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"f":"1","p":"2","s":"3","t":"5"},"description":"v1 : 1 oublié","variationIndex":1},{"answers":["\\{12;20\\}"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"k1":"3","k2":"3","k3":"4","k4":"2","k5":"3","k6":"3","k7":"3","w1":"2"},"description":"v2 : juste","variationIndex":2},{"answers":["\\{2;17\\}"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"k1":"3","k2":"3","k3":"4","k4":"2","k5":"3","k6":"3","k7":"3","w1":"2"},"description":"v2 : Ā ∩ B au lieu de A ∩ B","variationIndex":2}]}$plh$::jsonb,
